## Key Concepts

- Pub/Sub dead-lettering and alerting
- Beam stateful deduplication by transaction_id
- 1-minute tumbling windows per user_id with per-window aggregates
- Idempotent BigQuery writes via insertId
- Least-privilege IAM for Pub/Sub and BigQuery

